      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LOVING JESS (1) has been on speed at the last couple here and fought on to hit the frame, last outing finishing second beaten 0.8 lengths (17.18). Reliable out of the boxes and should take advantage of the inside draw. Overdue and gets her chance. SPIRIT GUIDE (4) has hit the frame in both career runs, the latest when third (17.11) over 300m at this track. Good beginner but will need a little luck from a middle draw. Looks one of the leading chances again. FEDERAL SABLE (2) is overdue for a maiden success having placed at four of 12 starts, the latest missing the frame when sixth at this track. Smart beginner who should take advantage of the low draw. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. ALL BARK (7) is worth including after a top-three finish most recently.",
